    "detailed_description": "Errships is a wild co-op game where you and your goblin pals build crazy flying machines out of junk. Team up to tackle increasingly tough challenges as you try to reach the top of a mysterious tower being guarded by mechanical baddies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet creative with the physics-based ship building system. Design all sorts of wacky vessels and see what your friends come up with too. Share blueprints online to show off your craziest ideas or get inspiration from other players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe real fun is in playing together. Join forces in roguelike runs to see how high you can climb. Can you and your crew overcome the tower's dangers and uncover its secrets? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nErrships blends teamwork, shipbuilding, and exciting challenges into one unique package. So gather your friends, slap together some scrap, and take to the skies. Adventure awaits!",
    "about_the_game": "Errships is a wild co-op game where you and your goblin pals build crazy flying machines out of junk. Team up to tackle increasingly tough challenges as you try to reach the top of a mysterious tower being guarded by mechanical baddies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet creative with the physics-based ship building system. Design all sorts of wacky vessels and see what your friends come up with too. Share blueprints online to show off your craziest ideas or get inspiration from other players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe real fun is in playing together. Join forces in roguelike runs to see how high you can climb. Can you and your crew overcome the tower's dangers and uncover its secrets? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nErrships blends teamwork, shipbuilding, and exciting challenges into one unique package. So gather your friends, slap together some scrap, and take to the skies. Adventure awaits!",
    "short_description": "Join forces with friends in Errships, a cooperative adventure where you construct epic flying contraptions and conquer escalating challenges. Unite with teamwork and defy the enigmatic tower to keep your scrap-filled vessel soaring high in the open skies.",
